  "PAY YOUR BILL THE EASY WAY! Skip the line, save time!\nNo need to visit a Negros Power Customer Care Center to settle your monthly electric bill. With our official and accredited Third-Party Collecting Agents, paying your bill is now more convenient and hassle-free!\nChoose from our wide range of payment channels:\nBANK PARTNERS\nPNB, BDO, BDO Network Bank, LANDBANK, BPI QuickPay, UnionBank, Producers Bank, Metrobank, Security Bank, Gotyme Bank and QueenBank.\nNON-BANK PARTNERS\nAlvio, GCash, Maya, USSC, RD Pawnshop, Palawan Express, PalawanPay, Pawnshop, Cebuana Lhuillier, CVM, CLIQQ by 7-Eleven, SM Bills Pay, SM Hypermarket, SM Markets, Savemore, LBP Kiosks, ShopeePay, and MariBank.\nECPay PARTNER OUTLETS\niMart ETAP Machine, Puregold ECPay Kiosk, and Globe Store ECPay Kiosk.\nMake bill payments easier and more convenient with Negros Power!\nChoose your preferred payment channel and pay with ease!\n#NegrosPower #BillsMadeEasy #ThirdPartyCollectingAgents"
